version: 1.2.2
keywords:
  - vertical cardinality
  - symbolic music analysis
  - textural cardinality
  - computational musicology
license: Proprietary
abstract: >-
  Cardinality-only symbolic toolkit with Gradio GUI, headless analyze-score CLI,
  and CSV/JSON exports for vertical note count, unique pitch count, and
  pitch-class cardinality over time in notated scores. Uses exact
  event-boundary temporal sampling so brief vertical states are not missed
  between grid points. Tie merging and half-open [onset, offset) activity
  semantics (package 1.2.2). Software validation includes micro-corpus
  regression fixtures and iav/analysis pitch-primitive parity tests; these
  do not constitute perceptual or corpus-based musicological validation.
